<section class="practice-section" id="practice" aria-labelledby="practice-title"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><span class="section-index">02 / ENGINEERING IN PRACTICE</span><h2 id="practice-title">The work behind<br><em>the working product.</em></h2></div><p>Some of the most valuable changes<br>never become a feature announcement.</p></div><div class="practice-list">
      <article class="practice-item"><div class="practice-label"><span class="eyebrow">OYECHATS / AI ENGINEERING</span><h3>Better answers start<br>before the answer.</h3></div><div class="practice-body"><p>I traced a relevance gate that was rejecting useful knowledge-base content, consolidated duplicated RAG pipelines, and moved qualification work onto a durable queue.</p><div class="result"><strong aria-label="15,233 down to 8,120">15,233 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> 8,120</strong><span>tokens in one assembled prompt,<br>as documented in the remediation PR</span></div><div class="inline-links"><a href="https://github.com/digibranders/oye-chats-platform/pull/450" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Retrieval diagnosis</a><a href="https://github.com/digibranders/oye-chats-platform/pull/455" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Prompt & durability work</a></div><a href="/projects/oyechats.html">Read the full story</a></div></article>
      <article class="practice-item"><div class="practice-label"><span class="eyebrow">CLEANSTART / PRODUCT ENGINEERING</span><h3>Fewer requests.<br>Correct timing.</h3></div><div class="practice-body"><p>I batched CMS relationship lookups and corrected cache invalidation that could happen before a database transaction committed.</p><div class="result"><strong aria-label="Approximately 75 down to 2">~75 <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> 2</strong><span>relationship requests for the<br>documented 25-row list view</span></div><div class="inline-links"><a href="https://github.com/digibranders/cleanstart-web/pull/279" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">CMS performance</a><a href="https://github.com/digibranders/cleanstart-web/pull/276" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Cache correctness</a></div><a href="/projects/cleanstart.html">Read the full story</a></div></article>
    <article class="practice-item"><div class="practice-label"><span class="eyebrow">ALSONOTIFY / PRODUCT SYSTEMS</span><h3>Trust is a<br>product feature.</h3></div><div class="practice-body"><p>Authentication, safer email rendering, and reporting rules that keep the interface and exported PDF in agreement.</p><div class="inline-links"><a href="/projects/alsonotify.html">Inside AlsoNotify</a><a href="/work.html">More engineering stories</a></div></div></article></div></div></section>
